  "answer": "This has been reported before: dropdowns (e.g. Startup > Default profile) in the Settings UI move out of the Terminal window when you scroll while they are open. It was originally tracked in #9320 (fixed by #10922), then regressed on Terminal Preview in #16629, apparently from a change in #16261, with the maintainers suspecting a dropped event handler. The past tickets contain no workaround and no confirmed fix for the current regression. The only advice is to avoid scrolling while a dropdown is open: close the dropdown (select an item or press Esc) before scrolling. Please add your version (1.24.11321.0) and a thumbs-up to #16629 so it can be prioritized."
